*   **Self-Employment Tax Deduction:** You can deduct 50% of the self-employment taxes you pay on your $12,500 marketing income as an adjustment to income.

### 3. How to Treat the Home Office
You can claim the home office deduction **only against your freelance marketing income**, not your W-2 income. Because you use the 130 sq ft *exclusively* for business, it qualifies. You have two ways to calculate this:
